Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那边  我的袋子里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're in my bag over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以给我留一个吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...could you leave me one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  给你  老兄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. There you go, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去疯吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是为了那件事用的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没留一个给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you imagine if I hadn't left you that last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个可能永远不会在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You two might've never gotten together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想像一下  如果我照原来计划  送了一个妓女上去会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, ooh. Can you imagine if I had sent that hooker up to the room like I was gonna?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像在天上一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like it was in the stars. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你们是注定在一起的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, totally meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他你原先那晚是要去找谁的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell him who you originally wanted to hook up with that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.35,0:14:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你原先是要去找谁的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who did you originally want to hook up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.69,0:15:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  拜托  不要生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, fine, but please don't be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我那时真的很沮丧  好吗  而且醉得很厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? I was really depressed, okay? And really drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.87,0:15:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想干点毫无意义的傻事  我只想...只想纯做爱  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted something stupid and meaningless. I just wanted...just sex. So
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那晚我到你们房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when I went to your room that night...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实是要找乔伊的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I was actually looking for Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来找乔伊的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You came to the room looking for Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有想过要告诉我  没有  我觉得这不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Were you planning on telling me this? No, I didn't think it was important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.27,0:15:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不重要  这不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not important? It's not important?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有那个伴娘  你嫁的会是他而不是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If it wasn't for a bridesmaid, you'd be marrying him not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你知道我有多高兴  乔伊不在那里吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! Do you know how unbelievably glad I am that Joey wasn't there that night!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:15:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我是神职人员  可是我还是有感觉的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a man of the cloth but I still have feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你不可能替我们证婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look there's no way you're doing this wedding now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不公平  不是我的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? That's not fair. It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和伴娘在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was off with my bridesmaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且谁说我会答应的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And who's to say I would've said yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我会答应的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I would've said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你把这件事看得太严重了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler look y-y-you are making way too big a deal out of this. all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是一切都很好嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everything worked out okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是很奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想站在那儿说婚誓时  脑子里全是你和摩妮卡的画面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? I don't want to be standing their saying my vows and then having the mental image of you and Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要  我不知道我要干什么  我要去走走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need-I don't know what I need. I need a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下  钱德  没有什么大不了的  对我是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, Chandler, come on, it's not a big deal. It is to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.37,0:16:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想和蝙蝠侠上床   可你不得不和罗宾将就着干了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanted to sleep with Batman and instead you had to settled for Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这太疯狂了  是啊  罗宾好像是同性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is crazy. No, Robin is so gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都同意了  不再恶作剧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So now what have we agreed? No more pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢  你和爸爸不是想分开下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What else? You and Daddy were not on a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你在这里干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, what are you doing here?
