Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的好朋友  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your good friend? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她姓什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's her last name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Carol...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同性恋  很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Lesbian. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  我脸上那条线\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By the way, that, uh-That line down my face...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在今天最后一堂课  让一个学生说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The line that prompted a student in my last class of the day to say:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"老兄  你从来不洗脸吗"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Dude, don't you ever wash your face?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  没有告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'm sorry. I'm sorry I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不要你再教我儿子那些鬼东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will be! Listen, I don't want you teaching my son that stuff anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.10,0:17:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我要告诉你  我一教他那些东西  他叫我"好玩的瑞秋阿姨"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I'll have you know that once I taught him that stuff, he called me "fun Aunt Rachel."
