Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你们能建立感情  但\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm glad you guys were bonding but--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:17:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  他没有任何兄弟姊妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, he doesn't have any brothers or sisters,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得有人教他这些东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Somebody has to teach him this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又没有教他任何  正常6岁孩子不该会的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I haven't taught him anything a normal 6-year-old doesn't know anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好烂  我要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Crap! I gotta go_
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要这块烤饼吗  是给我的  但它可能更想和你睡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want this scone? It came for me but it would probably rather sleep with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  什么都没发生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on Nothing even happened.
