Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.57,0:19:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过就说那些话   一字不差\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But those are the words. Those exact words.
