Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多  很多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And lots of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  甜心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  亲一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me a little sugar. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.35,0:20:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna go--?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  来  来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here we go, here we go, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.11,0:20:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还可以吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉要再麻烦你一次  你可以替我照顾一下小班吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry to do this again, but is there any way you can look after Ben for a bit?
