Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.27,0:21:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你背后有东西  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got something on your back. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.35,0:21:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great. That is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小班  我们才说完什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did we just finish talking about, Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.07,0:21:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"小班  我们才说完什么"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"What did we just finish talking about, Ben?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  够了  过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, That's it! Come—you—no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.49,0:21:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,年轻人  你麻烦大了  等下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're in big trouble, young man! No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小班  过来  我不是开玩笑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ben, come here! I am not kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停止  你们别这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No you guys, hold it. Seriously--
